	"Name": "AlertQuery - Okta - Lifecycle - System API - Okta API Token Created",
	"Description": "An Okta API token was created. An API token is a long-lived credential that bypasses interactive sign-in and MFA entirely, so creating one is a standard way to keep access to an org after the initial compromise.\n\nEvent type: system.api_token.create\n\nReference(s):\n- https://detection.fyi/elastic/detection-rules/integrations/okta/persistence_attempt_to_create_okta_api_token/\n- https://github.com/elastic/detection-rules/tree/main/rules/integrations/okta/persistence_attempt_to_create_okta_api_token.toml",
